  "assets": [
    {
      "uuid": "2fed3504-9f6a-4270-8fed-35049f6a5270",
      "name": "Getting Started.md",
      "path": "Assets/Tutorials/Getting Started.md",
      "assetType": "other",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "byteLength": 1505,
      "source": "---\ndismissible: true\ntemplate: coin-trail\n---\n# Coin Trail\n\nCollect six checkpoints in order. A gentle keyboard game with scoring, completion, and restart.\n\nWASD / arrow keys move. Collect the green checkpoint; the next appears after collection. Avoid pink circles. R restarts, including after a win or loss.\n\n## Edit and verify\n\nSelect named objects in Scene and change one component at a time. Play checks runtime behavior; Stop restores authored values. Save, reopen, and use Manage → Build to verify persistence and export. These are small complete checkpoint games; edit CheckpointGame.rhai to change course rules. All movement and hit tests use world units.\n\n\n## Controls and setup (en)\n\nPlay: WASD or arrow keys to move; R restarts. Collect the highlighted checkpoints in order and avoid red hazards.\n\n### Expected result\n\nThe HUD counts 6 checkpoints and shows a finish state. No time limit.\n\nRequirements: Ready offline · Keyboard\n\n## Steuerung und Einrichtung (de)\n\nPlay: WASD oder Pfeiltasten bewegen, R startet neu. Markierte Checkpoints der Reihe nach sammeln und roten Gefahren ausweichen.\n\n### Erwartetes Ergebnis\n\nDas HUD zählt 6 Checkpoints und zeigt den Abschluss. Ohne Zeitlimit.\n\nVoraussetzungen: Offline bereit · Tastatur\n\n## 操作与准备 (zh)\n\n播放后用 WASD 或方向键移动，R 重开。按顺序收集高亮检查点，避开红色障碍。\n\n### 预期结果\n\nHUD 记录 6 个检查点并显示完成状态。无时间限制。\n\n使用要求: 离线可用 · 键盘\n",
      "sourceModified": 0,
      "importedAt": 0,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "duration": 0,
      "fontFamily": "",
